{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras/2370eb2b68a2cfba552e07835d1a8794.avif?t=1771879942\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras_big/2370eb2b68a2cfba552e07835d1a8794.avif?t=1771879942 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sheep Quest</i> is a high-difficulty 2D platformer where you, a sheep of questionable qualifications and more courage than sense, are chosen by providence for a special quest.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap across traps clearly designed by sadists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that probably made sense to someone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against six bosses, each eager to remind you that wool is not armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 handcrafted levels await you, each more dangerous than the last</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab fate by the horns and uncover the secrets of the universe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master new abilities as you progress\u2014 double jump, ground slam, attack, dodge \u2014 transforming from a helpless lamb into a force capable of shaking the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey from the pastoral to the cosmic:<br>Launch to the moon, duel mechanical werewolves, brave alternate dimensions, and ascend to battle ancient gods beyond space and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you withstand the onslaught, seize your golden destiny, and bring the universe to its absurd conclusion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras/eef3bc932f5cedc72af2adbb9376dcd8.poster.avif?t=1771879942\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras/eef3bc932f5cedc72af2adbb9376dcd8.webm?t=1771879942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sheep is a Rope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375070/e6a5ac740e9efcaf3f4a91c9782aed5f2709dfaa.jpg"},{"name":"Houston, We Have a Problem Dog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375070/5c2619af9a7afa73d84432b01c7d526e3574699c.jpg"},{"name":"Lamb Led to Slaughter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375070/f14601a3fd5500712138321f1357d508aebd0200.jpg"},{"name":"Guffawpocalypse Now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375070/be596abbeaf8f7e2b8bcc628a66fdf96525ea301.jpg"},{"name":"Baby's First Apotheosis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375070/f95d637fa8aea19e5a31e44676ae27c59cd2cad8.jpg"},{"name":"Pursuit of Perfection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375070/f54e062744b7c8e231490e1a20ae0f026d467f72.jpg"},{"name":"My Horn Pierces the Heavens!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375070/82e4e6a25e8eb08cee94b7495755c46246bb13ac.jpg"},{"name":"Perfection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375070/8b4dca3810c3e4e766e71e9669a16e531d0132a4.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to Sheep Quest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375070/4df0f652307e311240225683a9d84468b1ca15a5.jpg"},{"name":"The Wolf Shall Die with the Lamb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375070/4d387f2033f1809a590dc1a1067e68e53a46fbc1.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3375070?t=1771879942","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3375070?t=1771879942","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/4612657513c139ef8be93dccd0966f60f3a8bb40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771879942","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/4612657513c139ef8be93dccd0966f60f3a8bb40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771879942","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras/2370eb2b68a2cfba552e07835d1a8794.avif?t=1771879942\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras_big/2370eb2b68a2cfba552e07835d1a8794.avif?t=1771879942 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sheep Quest</i> is a high-difficulty 2D platformer where you, a sheep of questionable qualifications and more courage than sense, are chosen by providence for a special quest.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap across traps clearly designed by sadists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that probably made sense to someone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against six bosses, each eager to remind you that wool is not armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 handcrafted levels await you, each more dangerous than the last</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab fate by the horns and uncover the secrets of the universe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master new abilities as you progress\u2014 double jump, ground slam, attack, dodge \u2014 transforming from a helpless lamb into a force capable of shaking the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey from the pastoral to the cosmic:<br>Launch to the moon, duel mechanical werewolves, brave alternate dimensions, and ascend to battle ancient gods beyond space and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you withstand the onslaught, seize your golden destiny, and bring the universe to its absurd conclusion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras/eef3bc932f5cedc72af2adbb9376dcd8.poster.avif?t=1771879942\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras/eef3bc932f5cedc72af2adbb9376dcd8.webm?t=1771879942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Lucas Peters"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/header.jpg?t=1771879942","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2024 Lucas Peters. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3375070/803496/fdb200b252119f3cfea2435db821d7272ccb5d98/1750845231/dash_av1.mpd?t=1735041199","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3375070/803496/fdb200b252119f3cfea2435db821d7272ccb5d98/1750845231/dash_h264.mpd?t=1735041199","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3375070/803496/fdb200b252119f3cfea2435db821d7272ccb5d98/1750845231/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1735041199","id":257084219,"name":"release trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257084219/244b104f0ce9fe027248ecde493c6089dfc02661/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1735041199